          "path": "_m/4/q/q/h/tierra-del-fuego-wk/estancia-in-tierra-del-fuego-f.jpg",
          "filename": "Estancia in Tierra del Fuego - Flickr - pellaea.jpg",
          "caption": "I never noted the name of this estancia: I stayed here with three French and a German cyclist.  I wonder what the workers thought when all these cyclists suddenly descended on them out of the gloomy dusk looking for a place to set up a tent.  \"Well, uh, yeah, I guess you can camp here...\" -- looking very confused, because after all, the entire countryside looked to them as good as any other for pitching a tent!  Personally, I slept under the building in the back right with the cat to keep me warm...",
          "alt": "I never noted the name of this estancia: I stayed here with three French and a German cyclist.  I wonder what the workers thought when all these cyclists suddenly descended on them out of the gloomy dusk looking for a place to set up a tent.  \"Well, uh, yeah, I guess you can camp here...\" -- looking very confused, because after all, the entire countryside looked to them as good as any other for pitching a tent!  Personally, I slept under the building in the back right with the cat to keep me warm...",
